      "message": "nit: reference PE_BIST_Carrier_Mode state for serachability? \n\nI don\u0027t seem to see a similar state to reference for BIST test data so I\u0027m uncertain how the spec envisions that working. Practically speaking, it makes sense to keep it in a separate state, if only to easily prevent us from breaking the requirement of sending no further messages via a stray DPM request or outstanding discovery item.",
