      "message": "This can also be a follow-up CL, but I\u0027m not seeing the requirement of \"When a Port receives a BIST Message BIST Data Object for a BIST Mode when not operating at vSafe5V, the BIST\nMessage Shall be Ignored\" being checked.  I leave it to you whether that belongs in READY or the entry state",
