      "writtenOn": "2020-12-02T16:58:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Re: your comment on the next CL about the PE deciding to put the TCPC in BIST mode, implementing this requirement might be what pushes the decision up into the PE.\n\nI\u0027ll note that I don\u0027t think we have the ability to control which BIST Messages the TCPC does and does not ignore.",
