      "writtenOn": "2020-12-02T23:43:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I suspect this decision would be best left to the PE, given the requirements.  The PE has to be \"in the know\" anyway to get into the right state, and it can boss around the TCPC accordingly while doing so.",
      "parentUuid": "53c495ec_2bd3cd1f",
      "revId": "afd64b291b31b086d841487acbd0c44a287e0c81",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
