      "writtenOn": "2020-12-02T16:38:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This can be a follow-up CL, but we should return to ready if we hit a mode we don\u0027t support.  Otherwise I don\u0027t see how we\u0027d ever exit this state short of a hard reset/disconnect.  You can cite \"When a Port receives a BIST Message BIST Data Object for a BIST Mode it does not support the BIST Message Shall be Ignored.\"",
      "revId": "afd64b291b31b086d841487acbd0c44a287e0c81",
